    "council": "Automatic Council in every table: emergency-buy reserve to cover projected unmet need first, then pay for submitted hub deliveries; never override a farmer\u2019s card. Transport and budget constrain actual delivery.",
    "cash": "Actual end-of-game cash, including early collective losses; only surviving farmers meeting their cash goal win.",
    "waste": "Spoiled harvest plus decay of farmer-owned stock; shared reserve never decays."
